{{!-- Video chapters — assets/js/video.js finds the first table in
the content whose left column is timestamps (0:45, 2:10, 1:02:30…)
and lifts it in here, wiring each row to seek the page's YouTube
embed. Starts hidden; video.js reveals it once it finds a table,
so this renders nothing for a post with no timestamp table. --}}
<div class="widget" data-chapters-widget hidden>
    <h4 class="widget-title">{{> "icons/list-icon"}} {{t "Chapters"}}</h4>
    <ol class="chapter-list" data-chapters></ol>
</div>
